  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> be the set of all complex numbers. Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Re</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></math>&nbsp;and</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>&#8211;</mo><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Then the number of elements in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8745;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8745;</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;equal to</p>",
